error[L0301]: a parameter must start with `:`
 --> expand/keyword_parameter_errors.rslisp:3:29
  |
3 | (defn untyped-start (:x i64 i64) x)
  |                             ^^^ here
  |
  = help: write each parameter as `:name type` or `:name`, as in (defn add (:x i64 :y i64) (+ x y))

error[L0301]: a function takes one `defaults` clause, after its parameters
